WEBVTT

00:07:57.473 --> 00:08:01.101
to walk the dirt road
where no one wants to go

00:08:01.101 --> 00:08:03.687
because that's where you
have fewer opportunities.

00:08:04.021 --> 00:08:09.902
And I was not going to let those girls
be marginalized and left in limbo.

00:08:11.028 --> 00:08:14.073
So from the moment they start speaking,

00:08:14.114 --> 00:08:16.075
to me,

00:08:16.116 --> 00:08:19.703
is the moment I start seeing
how we can move forward together.

00:08:20.829 --> 00:08:24.500
So we start doing,

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.254
as an organization,
we needed data, right?

00:08:29.004 --> 00:08:30.756
Because I've done it ten years,